# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit the filled-in file.

# Shared secret for POST /api/render.
#
# Leave unset and the endpoint is open — which is what you want for local
# development, where nothing but your own machine can reach it. Set it to a
# long random string anywhere the app is reachable by others, and callers must
# then send `Authorization: Bearer <the same value>`.
#
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
DOCUMAKE_RENDER_SECRET=
